&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset &amp;amp; Capabilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategist.&lt;/strong&gt; You think about narrative, audience priorities, and business impact first. You have a strong POV on what great looks like. You&#39;re comfortable pushing back with data and business logic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business fluent.&lt;/strong&gt; You understand Moloco&#39;s business, can speak credibly with Product and Sales leaders about customer problems and market dynamics, and make strategic decisions with business logic&lt;/li&gt;
