&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You’ll Be Contributing to Moloco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Growth Manager, you will own end-to-end growth strategy and outcomes for a portfolio of major advertisers, acting as a trusted external programmatic expert in the Greater China region. You will drive scalable growth, influence client decision-making through data and insights, and shape solutions that help advertisers unlock long-term value from Moloco’s platform.&lt;/p&gt;
