&lt;li&gt;Translate complex data into clear, compelling narratives for clients and internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design customized, data-driven strategies tailored to each client’s business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve ambiguous and complex client challenges by structuring problems, forming hypotheses, and driving aligned solutions across stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
