&lt;li&gt;Proactively convene and lead &lt;strong&gt;cross‑functional working sessions&lt;/strong&gt; (Sales, Product, DS, Eng) to diagnose complex performance issues and agree on a unified plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate recurring client and market patterns into &lt;strong&gt;structured feedback&lt;/strong&gt; that informs Sales and Product roadmaps for your segment.&lt;/li&gt;
