&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Moloco:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moloco builds some of the most powerful AI advertising solutions in the world. Our name—short for &quot;machine learning company&quot;—reflects our core mission: democratizing access to the advanced AI that has historically been reserved for tech giants. Led by machine learning pioneers who built some of the most successful ad systems at Google, including YouTube&#39;s monetization engine and key search advertising technologies, we&#39;re transforming how businesses grow and compete in the digital economy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built with AI from day one, Moloco’s planet-scale machine learning platform powers a suite of solutions for advertising growth and monetization. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/solutions/moloco-ads&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moloco Ads&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is an AI-powered platform that delivers real business outcomes for mobile app marketers through performance-based user acquisition. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/solutions/moloco-commerce-media&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moloco Commerce Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enables retailers and marketplaces to build revenue-generating ad businesses that balance user experience and advertiser performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moloco is headquartered in Silicon Valley, with offices in Seattle, New York, San Francisco, Seoul, Beijing, Singapore, Gurgaon, Tokyo, Shanghai, London, Tel Aviv, and Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moloco is a truly rewarding place to work and in an exciting period of growth, which you could be a part of. Join us today and apply now!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You’ll Be Contributing to Moloco:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute the product strategy, roadmap, and requirements for end-to-end Dynamic Product Ads (DPA) — spanning catalog/postback integration, campaign setup workflow, ML-based product recommendation, and creative UX optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product lifecycle from concept to experimentation and launch, ensuring each product delivers measurable customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish, monitor, and analyze KPIs to refine strategy, drive performance improvements, and guide data-informed decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional teams to deliver rapid, high-quality product iterations with clear business impact in a fast-paced, agile environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Synthesize data and insights from multiple internal and external sources to shape product strategy and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of industry trends and competitive dynamics to identify new product opportunities and positioning strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve day-to-day operational challenges proactively to ensure smooth execution and continuous product improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Moloco’s vision is to become the scaling engine for the internet economy — transforming the ad tech ecosystem to deliver greater value for advertisers and publishers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In this role, you will pioneer a zero-to-one product, building new services that help advertisers grow their businesses by leveraging Moloco’s world-class machine learning capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re looking for a passionate, analytical, and execution-driven Product Manager ready to drive innovation, unlock new advertiser verticals, and shape the future of Moloco’s growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How Do I Know if the Role is Right For Me?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A BS/MS degree in Computer Science, Electrical Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in Product Management or equivalent roles, with a proven track record of turning ambiguous business and technical requirements into clear, data-driven product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of mobile ad tech experience, ideally with expertise in Dynamic Product Ads (DPA) and/or Commerce Media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in leading 0 → 1 product strategies and launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An analytical mindset, using data to inform and drive key decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid understanding of go-to-market (GTM) cycles within product management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to align and influence across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience thriving in a fast-paced, iterative environment — building, testing, and learning quickly to deliver impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBA preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in personalization, recommendation, or ranking systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with commerce APIs, product feed management, and dynamic creative systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with SQL, Python, or other data analytics tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example Impact Areas&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building a product recommendation model that improves ad CTR by X%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrating with major e-commerce platforms to automate catalog/postback ingestion and campaign setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving UX experimentation to optimize ad unit performance across different inventory environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
