&lt;li&gt;Create comprehensive documentation and training programs for internal teams on program best practices, escalation procedures, policy updates to provide guidance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver measurable efficiency gains through AI and automation that ease resource constraints while improving service quality and productivity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report program performance with data; define structured KPIs, track them with automation, surface optimization opportunities proactively, and deliver actionable insights to leadership.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive alignment across Sales, Supply, Legal, and Product; where priorities compete, weigh the tradeoffs, make sound independent decisions, and communicate to ensure program alignment with technical requirements and business objectives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the product roadmap by translating operational pain points into well-defined technical requirements, backed by data-driven impact analysis and prioritization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
