&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Moloco:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moloco builds some of the most powerful AI advertising solutions in the world. Our name—short for &quot;machine learning company&quot;—reflects our core mission: democratizing access to the advanced AI that has historically been reserved for tech giants. Led by machine learning pioneers who built some of the most successful ad systems at Google, including YouTube&#39;s monetization engine and key search advertising technologies, we&#39;re transforming how businesses grow and compete in the digital economy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built with AI from day one, Moloco’s planet-scale machine learning platform powers a suite of solutions for advertising growth and monetization. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/solutions/moloco-ads&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moloco Ads&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is an AI-powered platform that delivers real business outcomes for mobile app marketers through performance-based user acquisition. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/solutions/moloco-commerce-media&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moloco Commerce Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enables retailers and marketplaces to build revenue-generating ad businesses that balance user experience and advertiser performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moloco is headquartered in Silicon Valley, with offices in Seattle, New York, San Francisco, Seoul, Beijing, Singapore, Gurgaon, Tokyo, Shanghai, London, Tel Aviv, and Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moloco is a truly rewarding place to work and in an exciting period of growth, which you could be a part of. Join us today and apply now!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You&#39;ll Be Contributing to Moloco:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Head of Marketing for Moloco Commerce Media (MCM), the lead marketer for one of Moloco&#39;s fastest-growing businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commerce media is one of the most important shifts in advertising, and Moloco brings something distinctive to it: the machine learning platform that powers performance at planet scale, now helping retailers and marketplaces build thriving ad businesses. In this role, you will develop the vision and strategy for marketing&#39;s role in establishing MCM as the category leader, and bring that story to the market through thoughtful positioning, customer partnership, and memorable moments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report directly to the CMO and serve on both the MCM and marketing leadership teams. You&#39;ll be supported by shared marketing functions, including product marketing, field marketing, campaigns, and communications, so you can focus on strategy, storytelling, and the work that matters most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Own Vision, Strategy, and Market Fluency&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the vision and end-to-end marketing strategy for elevating MCM to category leadership, and own the marketing plan across awareness, product storytelling, demand creation, and client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a deep understanding of the commerce media market, our customers, the business, and the product, and translate it into positioning, messaging, and a sequenced plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate as the strategic owner of the MCM marketing plan - end-to-end ownership is the top priority for this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Drive Product Marketing and Storytelling&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape product storytelling that highlights Moloco&#39;s unique technical capabilities: positioning, messaging, case studies, thought leadership, and the website.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build Customer Partnerships and Demand&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with top customers to bring our shared success stories to market while helping them grow their advertiser base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create demand with key audiences at target accounts through account-based marketing, product launches, industry events (such as Shoptalk, NRF, and Cannes), and owned events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strengthen Analyst and Ecosystem Relationships&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with analysts and ecosystem leaders to strengthen MCM&#39;s enterprise positioning and credibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Lead Across MCM and Marketing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a strategic member of the MCM and marketing leadership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive outcomes through shared marketing teams (field, campaigns, comms, web) that don&#39;t report directly to you, raising the quality bar across the function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How Do I Know if the Role is Right For Me?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 10+ years of marketing experience, including senior marketing leadership at an enterprise technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have demonstrated strategy experience, from consulting, retail leadership, or enterprise tech, and enjoy translating business direction into a clear, sequenced marketing plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a gifted storyteller who can translate complex technology (AI, machine learning, performance advertising) into clear, compelling messaging for enterprise audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build direct relationships with customers, listen closely, and bring their language and needs into the marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience creating enterprise demand across account-based marketing, events, and analyst engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are curious about AI and use AI tools in your everyday work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a track record of building or meaningfully advancing a category leadership position, not just executing within one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You stay steady under ambiguity, scoping it into a plan and keeping work moving without waiting for certainty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A plus, but not required:&lt;/strong&gt; retail domain experience, retail media experience, and/or technical fluency in digital advertising.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;U.S.-based employees have access to medical, dental, and vision insurance, a 401(k) plan with company match, short-term and long-term disability coverage, basic life insurance, and well-being benefits and perks. U.S.-based employees also receive up to 12 scheduled paid holidays per calendar year and one Thrive Day off per quarter. Additionally, all employees have Flexible Time Off (FTO).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The successful candidate may be eligible for a bonus and equity awards. Eligibility and amounts are determined by performance and the terms of the applicable plans. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The location for this role is listed above. For base pay range purposes, location-based compensation is grouped into the following regions. Your region is determined by your assigned work location.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
