&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Success &amp;amp; Relationship Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the day‑to‑day execution owner for new advertisers during implementation, managing campaign setup, monitoring, and reporting while escalating complex issues to senior team members as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand advertiser marketing objectives and support the execution of programmatic strategies to drive KPIs and early‑stage performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support client meetings, business reviews, and strategy discussions with guidance from Senior Implementation Managers and Sales / Growth leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong, trust‑based relationships with client stakeholders through clear communication, responsiveness, and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implementation, Performance &amp;amp; Handover&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure and QA campaigns, tracking, and reporting to ensure accurate setup and reliable measurement from the start.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze campaign performance data to identify issues, optimization opportunities, and early signals of product‑fit; share clear, actionable recommendations with clients and internal partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify incremental growth opportunities within existing setups (e.g., budget increases, creative tests, new geo or placement trials) and surface them to senior team members or Sales/Growth partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the transition from implementation to the Growth team by preparing concise documentation and performance debriefs that set long‑term owners up for success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross‑Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with New Business Sales to understand what was sold, customer expectations, and key success criteria for the first 90 days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Growth, Product, and Data Science to address configuration, measurement, and performance questions, and share client feedback that can improve our tools and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Powered Productivity &amp;amp; Tooling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI large language models (e.g., ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, NotebookLM) in day-to-day work — pitch prep, app/competitor research, account categorization, performance summaries, meeting notes, and client-facing materials — to improve quality and turnaround time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adopt and contribute to the team&#39;s internal AI workflows and tools, and help identify new opportunities to automate repetitive, low-value tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply sound judgment when using AI: verify outputs against source data, protect client and company confidentiality, and follow Moloco&#39;s responsible-AI and data-handling guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
