&lt;li&gt;3–5 years of experience in mobile advertising, ad tech, martech, or a related client‑facing role (implementation, technical account management, account management, or customer success).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands‑on experience with campaign setup and optimization, ideally on a DSP or similar performance platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to data analysis, campaign optimization, or digital marketing strategy and comfort working with numbers and reports.&lt;/li&gt;
