&lt;li&gt;Solid analytical skills and the ability to interpret performance data to inform recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the mobile ecosystem and ad tech fundamentals (MMPs, attribution, events, tracking) is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
