&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a strategic and experienced Product Marketing Lead to drive Moloco’s global product marketing strategy for consumer (ie non-gaming) companies. In this role, you will be responsible for shaping how we position, launch, and market our solutions to consumer app advertisers worldwide. You will develop compelling messaging, craft go-to-market strategies, enable sales teams, and collaborate cross-functionally to drive adoption and growth. This role requires a balance of strategic thinking and hands-on execution to help consumer apps maximize performance through Moloco’s advertising solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
