&lt;li&gt;Balance global and regional approaches to ensure marketing programs resonate across diverse markets and drive measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop positioning and messaging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
