&lt;li&gt;Have strong AI fluency and curiosity leveraging AI tools to accelerate impact. Be a strong product marketing partner with sales in the development of marketing assets and materials to move the business forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work iteratively with sales teams on pitch development, messaging, and demand tactics to rapidly identify the most effective path to product-market fit and scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop battlecards, sales narratives, and ABM programs that connect top-of-funnel awareness to pipeline and conversion outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
