&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in marketing or go-to-market roles, with at least 3 years in the mobile app performance marketing industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to develop and execute global marketing strategies that drive customer acquisition, product adoption, and revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the app marketing ecosystem, including user acquisition, monetization strategies, and key industry trends.&lt;/li&gt;
