&lt;li&gt;AI fluency in practice: You don&#39;t just talk about AI, you use it. You actively leverage AI tools to test messaging variations, iterate on content, and build campaigns faster across both product marketing and demand generation. You&#39;re excited to help build an AI-first GTM motion from scratch and see AI as a competitive advantage, not a shortcut.&lt;/li&gt;
