&lt;p&gt;Moloco is seeking a passionate and self-starting &lt;strong&gt;Supply Growth Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to lead our supply-side partnerships in Vietnam. In this role, you will be responsible for managing and expanding our relationships with both SDK publishers and SSPs/Exchanges. You will play a critical role in driving our business growth in the Vietnamese market by deepening engagement with existing partners and securing new integrations with top platforms and publishers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will combine strong partnership management with strategic deal-making to grow Moloco’s supply footprint across Vietnam. This includes managing strategic partner relationships, driving adoption of Moloco’s products, and negotiating new deals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, you will work closely with the SEA Regional Manager to align demand and supply strategies in the region. Together, you’ll support the growth of our clients by identifying supply opportunities, closing new deals, and ensuring supply coverage that meets advertiser needs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and expand Moloco’s relationships with SDK publishers in Vietnam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and close new supply partnerships with top apps and platforms in the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the SEA Regional Manager to align demand and supply strategies that support client growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional coordination with product, GTM, and ops teams to ensure the success of the partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Surface local market insights and partner feedback to influence Moloco’s supply products and go-to-market strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 years and above of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Account Management&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Publisher/Developer Relations&lt;/strong&gt; experience, ideally in &lt;strong&gt;mobile mediation platforms &lt;/strong&gt;or&lt;strong&gt; programmatic advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven &lt;strong&gt;negotiation skills&lt;/strong&gt; and experience closing commercial deals&lt;br&gt;Strong &lt;strong&gt;analytical skills&lt;/strong&gt; with the ability to work independently and drive partner decisions using data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent &lt;strong&gt;verbal and written communication&lt;/strong&gt; in both &lt;strong&gt;Vietnamese and English&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a &lt;strong&gt;fast-paced, cross-functional environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
